# Never let Windows line-ending translation near the media. Git detects most
# binaries on its own, but being explicit costs nothing and a mangled mp4 is
# invisible until the film refuses to decode in the browser.
*.mp4  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.png  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
